::: mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    User->>Business Analysis: Collect the Business Scenario 
    User->>Business Analysis: Prepare the User Story for the Requirement
    Business Analysis->>Dev: DevOps: Create a Work Item (CR/User Story).
    Business Analysis->>Dev: FDD: Prepare the FDD for the User Story.
    Loop FDD Scenarios
     Business Analysis->>Business Analysis: FDD-001...FDD-00N.
    end
    Business Analysis->>Dev: FDD: Review & Approve the FDD.
    Dev->> Test: TDD: Prepare the TDD by Developer
    loop FDD Scenarios
     Dev->>Dev: TDD-001...TDD-00N.
    end
    Dev->> Business Analysis: TDD: Review the TDD and Approve
    Business Analysis ->> Dev: TDD: Start the Development
    Dev->> Business Analysis: Review the solution
    Business Analysis->>Dev: If approved move the Solution
    Dev->>Test: Move the Solution
    Test->>Main/UAT: Create a Deployable package
    Main/UAT->>PROD: Deploy the CR to UAT 
    Main/UAT->>PROD: Plan for PROD Release
    Main/UAT->>PROD: Release Date?
    Main/UAT->>PROD: Inform the Key business users/Audience
    Main/UAT->>PROD: Schedule the code Promotion/Delivery
:::


